Z||000007||Shiner||06-17-2001||12:40 PM||||If I were you, I would stay away from fully faired bikes.  You set a ninja down in the parking lot, even at 15mph, and you WON'T be happy.  On the other hand, you could get a Honda Nighthawk cheap, and throw it down all you wanted.  Just some scraped up mirrors and pegs (and a little skin)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Whatever you do, take some classes.  You don't want to start having any bad habits when you ride.  You can get away with having bad habits while driving a car, but not on a bike.  ||||reg||1
Z||000008||JohnnyK||06-17-2001||06:41 PM||||The only bikes I would consider are full fairing sport bikes. I find all other motorcycles hideously ugly, ESPECIALLY the Nighthawk.  I would rather have my 67-68 mustang, but I'm poor at the moment.||||reg||1
